{
  "_comment": "Simulation (Pre/Post) over FreeCAD's FEM workbench, laid out as the analysis is done: the Home tab's groups are the workflow steps in order (step = the key fem_guide.py checks: finished steps are ticked, the next one is highlighted). The other tabs hold the full sets. 'optional' = a command only some FreeCAD builds have.",
  "title": "Pre/Post",
